{"id":34080599494785,"type":"artist","name":"Eloy","artist":null,"year":1969,"weight":17,"info":{"country":"DE","begin":"1969","kind":"Group","similar":["Nektar","Camel","Van der Graaf Generator","Triumvirat","Beggars Opera","Renaissance","Novalis","Birth Control","Fruupp","Barclay James Harvest"],"disambiguation":"German progressive rock band","img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/7e7f83f5d45e4566ae8add3b19089ac6/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Tomando prestado el nombre del libro \"La Máquina del Tiempo\" de Herbert George WELLS, ELOY se identifica con la idea de un nuevo comienzo gracias a la ayuda de una máquina de tiempo, a través de la cual pasaron de ser una banda que interpretaba temas de otros grupos a finales de los '60, atravesando por la problemática de no ser apreciados en su propio país, hasta llegar a ser una de las leyendas alemanas vivientes más sobresalientes de la escena progresiva mundial.","tags":["Progressive rock","space rock","krautrock","Psychedelic Rock","german"]},"works":[{"id":268254221275481,"type":"album","name":"Inside","artist":"Eloy","year":1973,"weight":3,"yt":"L4xg8CtKTh4","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":23428794615065,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Krautrock","rank":26,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":201461770465376,"type":"album","name":"Floating","artist":"Eloy","year":1974,"weight":5,"yt":"tZVcU4AyZTI","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":185548171992260,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Psychedelic Rock","rank":117,"scaruffi":null},{"id":208467523466790,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Space Rock","rank":26,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":197207814600868,"type":"album","name":"Power and the Passion","artist":"Eloy","year":1975,"weight":3,"yt":"JtUhkyPLxao","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":208467523466790,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Space Rock","rank":117,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":1809855709787,"type":"album","name":"Dawn